WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.900
To make the first walk happen, you add

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.880
a task to this week’s plan: choose a

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.140
trail for Saturday’s walk.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.560
When you’re ready to choose the trail, add

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.700
that task to Today.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.840
Open it, compare the trail links you’ve saved

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.660
alongside it, and choose one.
